\newlabel{fig:waterfall_wtp_hev}{{4}{21}{Simulated Net WTP versus observed price premium: HEV pairs. Bars decompose WTP (powertrain and operating cost) for real HEVs relative to each vehicle's closest conventional counterpart, by vehicle segment and budget tier. The blue point and error bar show simulated Net WTP (mean, 95\% interval); the dashed line is the observed mean price premium at approximately three years of age. Operating-cost contributions use EPA-based fuel-cost differentials at \$3.18 per gallon of gasoline. No matched HEV pair met the sample-size threshold in either low-budget segment}{figure.caption.9}{}}
